      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 9 year old female presented with 8 months history of right sided chest pain and respiratory distress. Chest X-ray revealed a large anterior mediastinal mass. Histopathology of the mass revealed features of an immature teratoma. The case is being presented because of its rare occurrence in the mediastinum."},
